  "description": "<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-69a0532a-5f6c-8385-a817-48700708437a-3\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-68\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"5fda0db9-d905-4f19-b12c-73837fee7cc6\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"381\">De <strong data-start=\"49\" data-end=\"90\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Corsair K70 RGB Pro Mini Wireless</span></strong> is een compacte 60% mechanische gaming-toetsenbord met draadloze connectiviteit en uitgebreide RGB-verlichting. Dankzij het kleine formaat is het toetsenbord ideaal voor gamers die meer ruimte willen voor muisbewegingen of een draagbare setup zoeken.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"392\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"421\"><strong data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"421\">Zo Goed Als Nieuw (ZGAN)</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"438\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"610\">\r\n<li data-start=\"439\" data-end=\"475\">\r\n<p data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"475\">⭐ Compact 60% gaming-toetsenbord</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"476\" data-end=\"519\">\r\n<p data-start=\"478\" data-end=\"519\">⭐ Draadloos via Slipstream of Bluetooth</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"520\" data-end=\"565\">\r\n<p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"565\">⭐ Mechanische switches met snelle respons</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"610\">\r\n<p data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"610\">⭐ Individueel instelbare RGB-verlichting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"632\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"1002\">\r\n<li data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"688\">\r\n<p data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"688\"><strong data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"652\">Merk & model:</strong> Corsair K70 RGB Pro Mini Wireless</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"738\">\r\n<p data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"738\"><strong data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"700\">Type:</strong> Mechanisch gaming-toetsenbord (60%)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"800\">\r\n<p data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"800\"><strong data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"760\">Connectiviteit:</strong> Slipstream Wireless, Bluetooth, USB-C</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"844\">\r\n<p data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"844\"><strong data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"816\">Switches:</strong> Cherry MX (hot-swappable)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"845\" data-end=\"881\">\r\n<p data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"881\"><strong data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"855\">RGB:</strong> Per-key RGB verlichting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"882\" data-end=\"927\">\r\n<p data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"927\"><strong data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"901\">Batterijduur:</strong> tot ±200 uur zonder RGB</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"962\">\r\n<p data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"962\"><strong data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"940\">Kleur:</strong> Niet gespecificeerd</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1002\">\r\n<p data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1002\"><strong data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"975\">Staat:</strong> Zo Goed Als Nieuw (ZGAN)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1022\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1072\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1038\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1038\">Toetsenbord</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1056\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1056\">USB-ontvanger</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1057\" data-end=\"1072\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1059\" data-end=\"1072\">USB-C kabel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1096\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1129\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>",
